  "risks_and_unfinished": ["No Mac execution or 60 FPS guarantee. The profiled final benchmark passed existing budgets; subsequent unprofiled captures failed under variable machine load and are retained here. Repeat on an otherwise idle host and on the packaged M3 Pro build.", "Native resize/text work can still put a zoom frame over 16.7 ms (about 20-23.5 ms in the representative final fixtures/live profile). Initial actor construction, many simultaneous effects or hazard births can still burst; native/other-workstream integration remains.", "Names can take up to 18 frames to populate a newly revealed 36-grub crowd at two/frame. Sprites and controls remain live; names and status/health are correct once shown.", "Synthetic screenshots prove the tested static/flame/pan/zoom views are unchanged, not every possible game state. Flame/gas viewport edges, hidden-label updates and offscreen active-actor zoom bounds have regression tests."],
